OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1984FThe first edition of the new
OL,7,Flook BBC early evening news programme
OL,8,Fairs on BBC One: Six o'Clock News.
OL,9,
OL,10,FThe new programme is edited by Ron
OL,11,FNeil. Sue Lawley and Nicholas Witchell
OL,12,F(who moved from the reporting staff to
OL,13,Fbecome a permanent member of the news
OL,14,Fpresenting team) present the first
OL,15,Fedition and would be the regular
OL,16,Fpresenters.
OL,17,
OL,18,FGeorge Fenton composed the new theme
OL,19,Ftune. Patrick Lunt - BBC Radio 2
OL,20,Fannouncer/news presenter - provided the
OL,21,Fopening voiceover, introducing the
OL,22,Fpresenters over the opening titles.
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
